Here is an example implementation of the `Encode` class in PHP:
```php
<?php

class Encode {
    private $type;
    private $params;

    public function __construct($type, $params) {
        $this->type = $type;
        $this->params = $params;
    }

    public function type() {
        return $this->type;
    }

    public function params() {
        return $this->params;
    }

    public function encode($string) {
        switch ($this->type) {
            case 1: // md5 encoding
                return md5($string);
            case 2: // base64 encoding
                return base64_encode($string);
            default:
                throw new Exception('Unsupported encoding type');
        }
    }
}
```
